      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter and brown sugar together until smooth and creamy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Sq0qpxvkGDrDZnpOLwwMqvkfCDU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11341-scottish-shortbread-IV-DDMFS-step-2-BG-1453-1d39534d1a62413898711746d6ca2ab3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11341/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add 3 to 3 3/4 cups flour; mix well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_aleavUctXHfv9E1jrHFKMRI5zM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11341-scottish-shortbread-IV-DDMFS-step-3-BG-1459-af16901ddf424c2bafd625f1878872b7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11341/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle board with remaining flour. Knead for 5 minutes, adding enough flour to make a soft dough.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/j4eB8yAAYTSuqxNeom7lbxP4Dag=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11341-scottish-shortbread-IV-DDMFS-step-4-BG-1480-abd3ec480bc54dc5bf7c06d5db2f9f1f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11341/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll out dough to 1/2-inch thickness. Cut into 3x1-inch strips.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Y7Dddf83Wtw-jwFHpp9zG_RooLg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11341-scottish-shortbread-IV-DDMFS-step-6-BG-1501-0db5d648e33044f7b438d2d2b3fb6311.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11341/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prick shortbread cookies with a fork and place on ungreased baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uDnqnqevzFe5t56tQ6BR4NNaM4s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11341-scottish-shortbread-IV-DDMFS-step-7-BG-1511-72067f6b744540c9a8757647236d2b45.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11341/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until edges are golden brown, 20 to 25 minutes. Cool on the baking sheet briefly before removing to a wire rack to cool completely.",
